.\" Manpage for nomad
.\" Source: github.com/caweis/project-nomad-mac-bundle (or current location)
.\" Format: mandoc / mdoc — render with `man nomad` after install
.Dd May 9, 2026
.Dt NOMAD 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nomad
.Nd Project NOMAD installer + lifecycle CLI for macOS
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
